WEBVTT

00:30.660 --> 00:32.300
Can I do, do?

02:03.850 --> 02:06.300
I'll prove that once and for all today!

02:29.140 --> 02:31.890
It's quiet tonight.

02:32.880 --> 02:36.620
Is that obnoxiously loud dog not around tonight?

02:36.620 --> 02:38.290
She's playing in the yard.

02:38.290 --> 02:39.290
Yard?

02:39.290 --> 02:40.820
Sasanaki Pass.

02:40.820 --> 02:43.690
The Knight of the Pass showed up in my yard.

02:43.690 --> 02:45.230
Sasanaki Pass?

02:45.230 --> 02:48.160
It seems she wants to win against the Knight.

02:48.160 --> 02:50.110
The Knight of the Pass?

02:51.130 --> 02:53.100
I've heard of him.

02:53.100 --> 02:55.770
They say he's a malicious Knight
who appeared in battle,

02:55.770 --> 02:59.080
and that he's a specter who never got over
his death in a riding accident.

03:02.840 --> 03:05.380
He just keeps racing across the mountain pass.

03:05.380 --> 03:10.560
They say he can finally rest in peace
if he encounters someone faster than himself.

03:11.320 --> 03:13.630
But it could just be an urban legend.

03:21.030 --> 03:23.500
Damn it, he didn't show up today, either.

03:23.500 --> 03:26.000
You can try a million times, but he won't come out.

03:26.000 --> 03:29.010
Shut up! I'll get him to come out tomorrow!

03:30.540 --> 03:32.640
Ah, I see she loves to run around.

03:32.640 --> 03:35.540
Dogs will be dogs, won't they, Princess?

03:35.540 --> 03:37.750
Reiri! Sheesh!

03:38.350 --> 03:40.380
What the hell are you doing here?!

03:40.380 --> 03:42.490
Having tea with the princess.

03:43.520 --> 03:46.520
It's nice to meet for tea at night, too,
from time to time.

03:46.520 --> 03:49.760
Whatever! Get the hell out of here!
You're an eyesore!

03:49.760 --> 03:54.500
Do you have what it takes
to make the Knight rest in peace?

03:54.500 --> 03:55.560
Screw you!

03:55.560 --> 04:00.560
What's the matter? You usually brag you're
the fastest to cross Sasanaki Pass.

04:01.340 --> 04:04.000
Whatever! Just you wait!

04:04.010 --> 04:07.150
I'll draw him and out and make him rest in peace!

04:10.180 --> 04:11.820
Huga.

04:12.010 --> 04:15.090
You too, Flandre?!
What are you laughing at?!

04:19.990 --> 04:23.320
Damn them, making fun of me like that...

04:23.330 --> 04:24.960
I'm back!

04:25.290 --> 04:27.090
Oh, Hiro.

04:27.100 --> 04:29.500
Are you going to Sasanaki Pass again today?

04:29.500 --> 04:32.300
Yup, today's the day I draw him out!

04:32.300 --> 04:34.900
I'll make Hime and Reiri eat their words!

04:34.900 --> 04:36.770
Plus, tonight's a full moon,

04:36.770 --> 04:38.750
so the odds are in my favor!

04:40.240 --> 04:42.050
See you later!

04:46.920 --> 04:49.360
Be careful, Liza!

04:52.650 --> 04:56.360
That smells great.
Looks like we're having curry tonight!

05:00.160 --> 05:02.160
Looks like they can't decide on a pitch.

05:02.160 --> 05:04.430
Okay, bases are loaded with two outs. They're down three runs.

05:04.430 --> 05:05.600
Maeda's at the plate.

05:05.600 --> 05:08.740
Cheney takes a huge wind-up and hurls the pitch!

05:08.740 --> 05:12.940
He got a whole lotta wood on that one! It could go all the way!
A home run!

05:12.940 --> 05:13.670
A grand slam!

05:13.680 --> 05:17.780
Wow, a home run! A home run!

05:18.050 --> 05:19.550
He hit it out of the park!

05:19.550 --> 05:21.190
Sis!

05:29.960 --> 05:33.930
Come on out, today's the day you rest in peace.

05:42.470 --> 05:44.210
There you are.

05:44.210 --> 05:47.190
I hope you're ready to finally move on!

05:55.620 --> 05:57.260
Wh..What?!

06:18.870 --> 06:22.480
What was that? He's missing his head!

06:29.450 --> 06:31.220
Bottom of the ninth and the court's at two-and-two.

06:31.220 --> 06:34.590
Swing for the fences! Swing for the fences!

06:34.590 --> 06:35.090
Is baseball really that exciting?

06:38.230 --> 06:38.860
Now he's back in...

06:38.860 --> 06:40.060
Yes, the one who hits the ball really far wins.

06:44.230 --> 06:46.870
He smacked it! This one's going past the track!

06:47.200 --> 06:49.500
A home run! A home run!

06:49.500 --> 06:52.770
Wow! Another home run!

06:52.770 --> 06:54.910
He did it!

06:54.910 --> 06:57.180
Wow! Home run! Home run!

06:59.450 --> 07:01.360
He did it! Yay!

07:03.050 --> 07:06.620
How'd it go? Did you set the new speed record?

07:13.400 --> 07:16.500
Liza, safety while driving is
the most important thing.

07:16.500 --> 07:18.910
I know! Now gimme seconds!

07:19.830 --> 07:23.170
Liza, you said he was headless, right?

07:23.170 --> 07:24.810
Yeah...

07:25.070 --> 07:28.450
He looked pretty strange without a head.

07:30.950 --> 07:35.780
Yeah, maybe he's rampaging about
because he lost his head.

07:35.780 --> 07:39.750
Do you think he'd go back to how he was before
if he got his head back?

07:39.750 --> 07:41.560
Who knows.

07:43.360 --> 07:44.690
Huga.

07:44.690 --> 07:46.430
Well, it's clear what we have to do.

07:46.430 --> 07:48.000
All right, let's go, Hiro!

07:48.000 --> 07:49.630
Huh? Go where?

07:49.630 --> 07:53.370
Isn't it obvious? To look for his
head in Sasanaki Pass.

07:53.370 --> 07:56.970
We'll hurry and find his head
and then I'll race him again.

07:56.970 --> 07:59.170
I'll make sure he rests in peace this time!

07:59.170 --> 08:01.310
But you're injured, Liza.

08:01.310 --> 08:03.220
I'm fine now! Let's go!

08:05.110 --> 08:06.750
Oh?

08:07.720 --> 08:10.150
What about your food, Liza?

08:10.150 --> 08:12.320
I'll eat it when we get back.
Leave it out for me!

08:12.320 --> 08:14.660
Hold on a second, Liza!

08:14.660 --> 08:17.500
Don't get in Liza's way, Hiro.

08:18.730 --> 08:24.200
All right? I'm gonna prove that I'm the
fastest one in Sasanaki Pass.

08:34.840 --> 08:37.680
A headless knight, huh?

08:37.680 --> 08:39.320
Huga.

08:48.720 --> 08:52.640
Hiro, you search around here.
I'll search up above.

08:58.670 --> 09:01.200
Come on out, head!

09:01.740 --> 09:05.050
A head won't respond back to me, I guess, huh?

09:17.850 --> 09:19.830
Not here, huh?

09:21.060 --> 09:23.040
Not here, either.

09:33.000 --> 09:35.470
Oh, my goodness.

09:35.470 --> 09:38.910
Seems we've got an injured patient here.

09:38.910 --> 09:43.410
Better hurry and get you to the
hospital to be treated.

09:43.410 --> 09:46.650
Okay, move Hiro Hiyorimi into the ambulance!

09:46.650 --> 09:48.850
Nice and easy, now!

09:48.850 --> 09:50.350
We've taken the patient.

09:55.720 --> 09:57.700
Hey! What's the big...

09:59.660 --> 10:01.930
Oh, that's no good.

10:01.930 --> 10:03.700
Our patient's injuries have worsened.

10:03.700 --> 10:06.610
We'd better hurry.

10:12.040 --> 10:15.610
We'll have him there in a jiff, Master.

10:22.320 --> 10:24.220
I didn't find anything above.

10:24.220 --> 10:27.630
How'd you make out here, Hiro? Any luck?

10:38.170 --> 10:39.270
Where am I?

10:39.270 --> 10:42.200
Yes, you're in Sasanaki General Hospital.

10:42.200 --> 10:47.710
You're a regular here these days, Hiro Hiyorimi.

10:49.510 --> 10:51.040
A regular?

10:51.050 --> 10:52.610
You're the one who dragged me here!

10:52.610 --> 10:55.820
Drop your guard for just a second and
you can end up injured for life!

10:55.820 --> 10:57.550
This must be fate.

10:57.550 --> 11:00.590
Since you've come all the way here,
I'll introduce you to my master.

11:00.790 --> 11:02.490
Master?

11:02.490 --> 11:05.990
And not the kind of "master" that
you'd find in a coffee shop.

11:06.630 --> 11:10.100
This master is the ruler of this hospital!

11:10.100 --> 11:14.380
Ruler? Aren't you the Chief of Medicine?

11:15.900 --> 11:19.770
He easily surpasses my very existence.

11:19.770 --> 11:23.650
He's my master!

11:24.550 --> 11:29.350
It's not often my master meets
with plain folk like you.

11:29.350 --> 11:31.520
You should be grateful.

11:35.660 --> 11:38.730
The master is in the room.

11:38.730 --> 11:40.730
Come now, Hiro.

11:41.630 --> 11:43.400
Enter.

11:49.300 --> 11:51.440
I've been waiting for you.

11:59.610 --> 12:01.420
Nice to meet you,

12:02.850 --> 12:04.690
Hiro Hiyorimi.

12:04.690 --> 12:07.150
Y..You're...

12:07.160 --> 12:09.160
Please, take a seat.

12:11.630 --> 12:14.270
My name is Zeppeli.

12:15.260 --> 12:17.000
Zeppeli...

12:17.000 --> 12:19.030
Yes, the name's Zeppeli.

12:19.030 --> 12:21.010
How can I put this?

12:21.770 --> 12:25.040
I'm from the same race as Reiri.

12:25.040 --> 12:27.070
Do you catch my drift?

12:27.080 --> 12:29.010
A vampire?!

12:29.010 --> 12:31.120
Precisely.

12:31.650 --> 12:35.360
So, you're after Hime's life as well?

12:36.580 --> 12:38.520
That's a good question.

12:38.520 --> 12:42.320
Certainly, the princess's blood
would be delectable,

12:42.320 --> 12:46.490
but I'd also like to become friends with you.

12:46.490 --> 12:48.130
Huh?

12:49.160 --> 12:54.160
We've got a river of sons separating us,
that is, a feud.

12:54.270 --> 12:59.270
I'd like to give you a token of friendship as the
first gesture towards burying the hatchet.

13:00.270 --> 13:02.010
Will you accept?

13:02.010 --> 13:04.010
A token of friendship?

13:04.510 --> 13:07.390
This is said token of friendship.

13:11.050 --> 13:13.120
Wh..What is it?

13:13.120 --> 13:16.830
Weren't you searching for something?

13:18.960 --> 13:22.570
That's the Knight's head?

13:45.090 --> 13:46.720
Hiro,

13:47.160 --> 13:51.660
I don't think it would be very attractive for
me to do something as barbarous

13:51.660 --> 13:53.900
as drinking the princess's blood against her will.

13:56.260 --> 13:58.130
You see,

13:58.130 --> 14:01.440
I want to come to a mutual understanding
with her via art.

14:01.440 --> 14:03.280
L..l see.

14:04.210 --> 14:06.870
I want to get close to her.

14:06.870 --> 14:09.180
But that's...

14:09.940 --> 14:15.950
Certainly, it will take some time and effort
to build a bridge across said river.

14:16.680 --> 14:19.220
I have no idea what you're...

14:21.020 --> 14:22.990
Have fun.

14:22.990 --> 14:25.190
Wh..What on Earth are you doing?!

14:25.190 --> 14:26.830
Seriously...

14:40.780 --> 14:45.780
Hiro! Hiro! He's our man!

14:46.110 --> 14:48.010
If he can't do it, no one can!

14:48.020 --> 14:50.980
Three cheers for Hiro on his voyage!

14:50.990 --> 14:52.290
Banzai!

14:58.530 --> 15:02.600
It's impolite to peep, Ms. Reiri.

15:03.330 --> 15:06.600
Using Hiro to draw the princess out...

15:06.600 --> 15:09.240
I didn't think you'd have such bad taste,

15:09.240 --> 15:10.880
Zeppeli.

15:11.740 --> 15:16.340
Time will tell whether my art is in bad taste or not.

15:16.340 --> 15:20.280
You're a true troublemaker, Zeppeli.

15:20.280 --> 15:25.280
Why don't I join you in your crude
entertainment, just for tonight?

15:26.620 --> 15:29.830
Oh? What brought on the change of heart?

15:30.930 --> 15:32.930
I'm just feeling a little capricious.

15:46.540 --> 15:50.850
I don't remember making plans
for a tea party tonight.

15:51.910 --> 15:54.090
My, such cold words.

15:55.320 --> 15:58.920
I have something much more fun
than a tea party planned.

15:58.920 --> 16:01.490
Oh? You've got my attention now.

16:12.500 --> 16:16.170
Hiro! Hey!

16:16.170 --> 16:17.910
Hiro!

16:20.410 --> 16:22.220
What the...?

16:25.510 --> 16:27.390
Give me my body!

16:28.220 --> 16:29.580
Who the hell are you?!

16:29.580 --> 16:31.390
My body!

16:38.790 --> 16:40.430
Damn...

16:40.560 --> 16:42.200
Y..You!

16:46.030 --> 16:47.840
Damn it!

16:54.840 --> 16:56.820
What incredible power.

17:02.020 --> 17:06.190
He's unbelievably strong, but I'm sure it's Hiro.

17:06.650 --> 17:09.920
Is he being controlled by the
power of that helmet?

17:09.920 --> 17:13.800
I could easily kick his ass, but Hiro's in there.

17:28.140 --> 17:30.780
Damn, it's tough.

17:31.680 --> 17:33.590
Stay still, Hiro!

17:47.530 --> 17:49.170
Damn!

18:00.310 --> 18:02.050
H..Hiro!

18:03.510 --> 18:06.460
The body and head joined.

18:09.780 --> 18:11.760
Is he back to his senses now?

18:17.330 --> 18:19.070
D..Damn! Hiro!

18:22.600 --> 18:24.240
Damn...

18:31.970 --> 18:33.610
Damn it! Hiro!

18:41.020 --> 18:42.820
Hold your horses!

18:48.820 --> 18:52.290
Ow, ow, ow, ow, ow...

18:55.060 --> 18:56.530
It's Flandre!

18:56.530 --> 18:58.170
Huga.

19:02.170 --> 19:04.010
Ah, this will work!

19:20.090 --> 19:21.930
A home run, eh?

19:40.910 --> 19:42.720
Nice swing!

19:49.450 --> 19:52.260
The Knight's back to his senses now, huh?

19:52.920 --> 19:54.050
Huga.

19:54.060 --> 19:55.690
Right.

19:56.020 --> 19:59.770
Liza's race begins now.

20:01.400 --> 20:03.270
Shall we settle this?

20:07.800 --> 20:12.380
Listen, I'm gonna show you who's the
fastest through Sasanaki Pass!

20:19.250 --> 20:20.550
Huga!

20:22.680 --> 20:25.160
He's meddling with things again, huh?

20:32.830 --> 20:36.370
I'm just glad the princess is having a good time.

20:37.900 --> 20:40.640
The entertainment hasn't even begun yet.

20:42.640 --> 20:47.210
Well, what shall we have them do
to entertain us next?

20:56.980 --> 20:59.970
No one can get through Sasanaki Pass
faster than me!

21:20.310 --> 21:22.340
That was a good race.

21:25.050 --> 21:27.180
Rest in peace.

21:39.130 --> 21:42.110
I told you I was the fastest!

21:43.400 --> 21:45.380
So? Did you see?

21:46.970 --> 21:49.070
I wasn't paying attention.

21:49.070 --> 21:51.470
Hime! Damn you...

21:51.470 --> 21:52.770
Hiro!

21:52.770 --> 21:56.910
Sorry, I can't remember a thing.

21:56.910 --> 21:59.280
Flandrel I know you saw me!

21:59.280 --> 22:00.550
Huga.

22:00.550 --> 22:03.380
You guys need to watch!

22:03.380 --> 22:07.230
I was the fastest one to cross Sasanaki Pass!

23:42.650 --> 23:45.620
What do you think, Flandre?
Do I look strange to you?

23:45.620 --> 23:49.190
Hiro, where are you going,
dressed all crazy like that?

23:49.190 --> 23:52.290
A classmate invited me to go play at their house.

23:52.290 --> 23:55.130
You're going to play in a tuxedo,
with your hair slicked back?

23:55.130 --> 23:58.130
Oh, right! What should I take as a gift?

23:58.130 --> 23:59.830
You don't need to take a gift.

23:59.830 --> 24:03.200
But it's my first time going to play
at someone's house.

24:03.200 --> 24:05.370
I'm not sure what to do.

24:05.370 --> 24:07.710
Next episode, "Princess Visitation"

24:07.710 --> 24:07.870
I genuinely feel bad for you.

24:09.310 --> 24:10.790
Huga, huga.
